104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (By bringing cloud-native automation principles down to the individual kiosk, this system ensures that even a catastrophic crash in the POS software does not lead to significant downtime. The application acts as an intelligent watchdog, constantly verifying that critical processes are active and responsive. This approach is not just about keeping the software running; it is about protecting the financial throughput of the retail store and maintaining a seamless experience for the customer. The result is a high-availability infrastructure that functions as an autonomous edge- cloud node, resilient against both local application errors and intermittent environmental glitches.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
