/E (Additionally, the project can be expanded into a Distributed Fleet Management system. By containerizing the monitoring daemon using Docker, the architecture could be deployed across thousands of globally distributed retail franchises. A centralized cloud control plane would then aggregate telemetry from every individual edge-node, providing corporate headquarters with a real-time global overview of their IT infrastructure health and total revenue throughput without requiring on-site staff to submit any reports.)
