/P 71 0 R
/E (The "AI Self-Healing Cloud for Retail" project successfully demonstrates that high- end Service Reliability Engineering \(SRE\) can be effectively downscaled for localized retail environments. By replacing manual troubleshooting with an intelligent, autonomous Python script, the system drastically reduces Mean Time to Recovery \(MTTR\) from several minutes down to a fraction of a second. This ensures that Point-of-Sale operations remain continuous, safeguarding the financial throughput of the business and maintaining a superior customer experience. This project serves as a scalable and modern blueprint for the future of decentralized IT operations, proving that software automation at the edge is the most efficient method for maintaining high availability in the retail sector.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
